  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-lightyellow pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Absolute Kinetic Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c7/The_Flash_absorbing_Eartsh_kinetic_energy.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20210712051601\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"The Flash absorbing Eartsh kinetic energy\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c7/The_Flash_absorbing_Eartsh_kinetic_energy.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/209?cb=20210712051601\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c7/The_Flash_absorbing_Eartsh_kinetic_energy.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/209?cb=20210712051601 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/c7/The_Flash_absorbing_Eartsh_kinetic_energy.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20210712051601 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"The Flash absorbing Eartsh kinetic energy\" width=\"210\" height=\"500\" data-image-key=\"The_Flash_absorbing_Eartsh_kinetic_energy.jpg\" data-image-name=\"The Flash absorbing Eartsh kinetic energy.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Flash (DC Comics) mastery of the Speed Force allows him to draw in limitless amounts of inertial &amp; momentum dynamisms. Including that of an entire planet if need be.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Store an infinite amount of kinetic energy in your body.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>store an infinite or nearly infinite amount of kinetic energy in your body</b>. Advanced version of <a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Kinetic Energy Absorption\">Kinetic Energy Absorption</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Energy Absorption\">Absolute Energy Absorption</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Kinetic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Kinetic Dynamo\">Bio-Kinetic Dynamo</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Kinetic_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Absolute Kinetic Storage</li>\n<li>Infinite Kinetic Absorption</li>\n<li>Ultimate Kinetic Capacitor</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Kinetic_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user's body is capable of containing an infinite amount of kinetic energy, they can absorb as much as they want. This can allow the user the energy required to use other superhuman abilities, survive long amounts of time without food, or output energy for long periods of time.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Kinetic_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Bio-Energetic_Sourcing\" title=\"Absolute Bio-Energetic Sourcing\">Absolute Bio-Energetic Sourcing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Capacitor\" title=\"Bio-Capacitor\">Bio-Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Conversion\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Conversion\">Bio-Energetic Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Transduction\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Transduction\">Bio-Energetic Transduction</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energizing\" title=\"Bio-Energizing\">Bio-Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Power_Plant\" title=\"Living Power Plant\">Living Power Plant</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Concentration\" title=\"Bio-Energy Concentration\">Bio-Energy Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Ionization\" title=\"Energetic Ionization\">Energetic Ionization</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Plasma_Fire_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Plasma Fire Manipulation\">Bio-Plasma Fire Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Combustion\" title=\"Energetic Combustion\">Energetic Combustion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Heating\" title=\"Energetic Heating\">Energetic Heating</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Electromagnetic_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Electromagnetic Absorption\">Absolute Electromagnetic Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Heat_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Heat Absorption\">Absolute Heat Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Sound_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Sound Absorption\">Absolute Sound Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Level_Infinitum\" title=\"Power Level Infinitum\">Power Level Infinitum</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Condition_Infinitum\" title=\"Condition Infinitum\">Condition Infinitum</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Beauty_Infinitum\" title=\"Beauty Infinitum\">Beauty Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Durability_Infinitum\" title=\"Durability Infinitum\">Durability Infinitum</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Durability_Concentration\" title=\"Durability Concentration\">Durability Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Infinite_Supply\" title=\"Infinite Supply\">Infinite Supply</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Durability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Peak Human Durability\">Peak Human</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Durability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Durability\">Enhanced</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Durability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Durability\">Supernatural Durability</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Invulnerability\">Invulnerability</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Invulnerability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absolute Invulnerability\">Absolute Invulnerability</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Flawless_Indestructibility\" title=\"Flawless Indestructibility\">Flawless Indestructibility</a> - As one's permanence increases.\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lesser_Immunity\" title=\"Lesser Immunity\">Lesser Immunity</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence_Infinitum\" title=\"Intelligence Infinitum\">Intelligence Infinitum</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Clear_Mind\" title=\"Clear Mind\">Clear Mind</a> - with ever expanding intellect one can unlock all of the mental boundary's by shunting excessive cognitive blocks.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Infinite_Supply\" title=\"Infinite Supply\">Infinite Supply</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Intelligence\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Peak Human Intelligence\">Peak Human</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Intelligence\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Intelligence\">Enhanced</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Intelligence\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Intelligence\">Supernatural</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Nigh-Omniscience\" title=\"Nigh-Omniscience\">Nigh-Omniscience</a> - as their intelligence increases.\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Brain_Capacity\" title=\"Enhanced Brain Capacity\">Enhanced Brain Capacity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Brain_Capacity\" title=\"Supernatural Brain Capacity\">Supernatural Brain Capacity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Encyclopedic_Knowledge\" title=\"Encyclopedic Knowledge\">Encyclopedic</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Forbidden_Knowledge\" title=\"Forbidden Knowledge\">Forbidden</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Knowledge\" title=\"Cosmic Knowledge\">Cosmic Knowledge</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Optimal_Finesse\" title=\"Optimal Finesse\">Optimal Finesse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Perpetual_Augmentation\" title=\"Perpetual Augmentation\">Perpetual Augmentation</a>; Intelligence only</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Speed_Infinitum\" title=\"Speed Infinitum\">Speed Infinitum</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Perpetual_Augmentation\" title=\"Perpetual Augmentation\">Perpetual Augmentation</a>; speed only\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Speed\" title=\"Speed\">Peak Human</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Speed/Enhanced\" title=\"Speed/Enhanced\">Enhanced</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Speed/Supernatural\" title=\"Speed/Supernatural\">Supernatural</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Speed/Absolute\" title=\"Speed/Absolute\">Absolute Speed</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Instant_Effect\"